  "scope": "The actual smooth finite-energy Hamilton graph, with the differential and nonlocal equations imposed on the positive half-line, is single-valued on L2 radial energy coordinates. Energy coordinate equality determines C1 profiles on the positive half-line. Both actual half-line operators respect this equivalence, including the nonlocal integral. No closed graph, dense domain, linearity, graph closability or evolution generation is proved."
